 "sourceForm": "anthology-story",
 "title": {
  "ta": "உயிருக்கு விலை ஐம்பது லட்சம்",
  "en": "Fifty Lakhs — The Price of a Life"
 },
 "author": {
  "nameTa": "மு. கருணாநிதி"
 },
 "tamil": {
  "blocks": [
   {
    "kind": "heading",
    "text": "உயிருக்கு விலை ஐம்பது லட்சம்",
    "sourceScan": 42,
    "printedPage": 41
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "மிஸ்டர் லஞ்சய்யா, “யார் அது?” என்று அதட்டுகிறார்",
      "sourceScan": 42,
      "printedPage": 41,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“நான் தான் எமதர்மன்”",
      "sourceScan": 42,
      "printedPage": 41,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“எருமை வாகனம் எங்கே?”",
      "sourceScan": 42,
      "printedPage": 41,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“அரசாங்க இலாகாக்களுக்கு இரவல் கொடுத்திருக்கிறேன்.”",
      "sourceScan": 42,
      "printedPage": 41,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“அவர்களது ஆமை வாகனம் என்ன ஆயிற்று?”",
      "sourceScan": 42,
      "printedPage": 41,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“அது ரிப்பேரில் இருக்கிறது”",
      "sourceScan": 42,
      "printedPage": 41,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“நத்தை வாகனம் கூடவா?”",
      "sourceScan": 42,
      "printedPage": 41,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“அதைத்தான் நகர சபைகளுக்கான நீர்வாகத்திற்கு அனுப்பி விட்டார்களே!”",
      "sourceScan": 42,
      "printedPage": 41,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“ஓஹோ! இலாகாக்களுக்கு எருமையையும், நத்தையையும் வைத்துக் கொண்டு, தெருவில் மனிதர்கள் மீது மோத மட்டும் மான் வாகனம், முயல் வாகனங்களை வைத்திருக்கிறார்களா?”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“அது கிடக்கட்டும். வா போகலாம்”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“எங்கே?”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“இன்னுமா தெரியவில்லை? நீ செத்துவிட்டாய், யமலோகம் போகலாம் வா”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“யமலோகமா? அங்கே பஞ்சாயத்து யூனியன்,முனிசிபாலிடி, கார்ப்பரேஷன், சட்டசபை, மேல்சபை, பார்லிமெண்ட், ராஜ்ய சபா முதலியவை உண்டா? கட்சிகள் உண்டா? தேர்தல்கள் உண்டா?”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“ஒரு சனியனும் இல்லை. ஒரே அமைதியான உலகம்!”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "‘சே, சே. அமைதியான இடமே எனக்குப் பிடிக்காது. என் காரியம் நடக்க அமளி துமளி அதிகம் இருக்க வேண்டும்... உன்னுடன் வருவதற்கில்லை.”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“மிஸ்டர் லஞ்சய்யா! நீங்கள் அப்படிச் சொல்லக் கூடாது. பிறகு நான் கடமையிலிருந்து தவறிவிட்டேன் என்ற களங்கம் வந்து சேரும்”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“ஓய் எமதர்மா! உமக்குக் களங்கம் வராமல் இருக்க ஒரே வழி என்ன தெரியுமா?.... நான் உன்னோடு வருவதாக இருந்தால் ஐந்து லட்சம் ரூபாய்க்கு இப்பொழுதே செக் தரவேண்டும்.”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "எமதர்மனுக்குத் தலை கிறுகிறுத்தது. “சாவதற்கும் லஞ்சமா?” என்று முணுமுணுக்கிறான்.",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“.... அடுத்த ஜென்மம் பிறப்பதாயிருந்தால் அதற்கும் கேட்பேன் தெரியுமா....”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“.... அடுத்த பிறவி எடுக்க வேண்டாம், அதற்கும் சேர்த்து இப்போதே கேட்டுவிடு, கொஞ்சம் ‘கன்சஷன்’ கொடு”",
      "sourceScan": 44,
      "printedPage": 43,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“....பத்து லட்சம் கொடுத்துவிடு”",
      "sourceScan": 44,
      "printedPage": 43,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“.... இவனைக் காசாலேதான் சாக அடிக்க வேண்டும்” என்று ஒரு செக்கை எடுத்து எழுதுகிறான் எமன். அந்தச் செக்கை நீட்டி.",
      "sourceScan": 44,
      "printedPage": 43,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“இந்தா காசாலேசா! நீ காசாலே சா!”",
      "sourceScan": 44,
      "printedPage": 43,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "மிஸ்டர் லஞ்சய்யா செக்கைப் பார்க்கிறார். “ஐம்பது லட்சம்”",
      "sourceScan": 44,
      "printedPage": 43,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“ஆ! ஐம்பது லட்சம்!” மிஸ்டர் லஞ்சய்யா வாயைப் பிளக்கிறார்.",
      "sourceScan": 44,
      "printedPage": 43,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "பிறகு வாயை மூடவே இல்லை.",
      "sourceScan": 44,
      "printedPage": 43,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
 "english": {
  "blocks": [
   {
    "kind": "heading",
    "text": "Fifty Lakhs — The Price of a Life",
    "sourceScan": 42,
    "printedPage": 41
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "Mr. Lanjayya barks, “Who is that?”",
      "sourceScan": 42,
      "printedPage": 41,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“It is I, Yama-Dharma.”",
      "sourceScan": 42,
      "printedPage": 41,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“Where is your buffalo vehicle?”",
      "sourceScan": 42,
      "printedPage": 41,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“I have lent it to the government departments.”",
      "sourceScan": 42,
      "printedPage": 41,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“What happened to their tortoise vehicle?”",
      "sourceScan": 42,
      "printedPage": 41,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“It is under repair.”",
      "sourceScan": 42,
      "printedPage": 41,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“The snail vehicle too?”",
      "sourceScan": 42,
      "printedPage": 41,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“That one has been sent to the city councils for their water service!”",
      "sourceScan": 42,
      "printedPage": 41,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“Oh! So the departments keep the buffalo and the snail, but when it comes to colliding with people in the streets they keep deer vehicles and rabbit vehicles?”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“Leave that aside. Come, let us go.”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“Where?”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“Do you still not understand? You are dead. Come, let us go to Yamaloka.”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“Yamaloka? Are there Panchayat Unions, municipalities, corporations, a Legislative Assembly, an Upper House, Parliament, Rajya Sabha and so on there? Are there parties? Are there elections?”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“Not a single nuisance. Just one peaceful world!”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "‘Tch, tch. I do not like peaceful places at all. For my affairs to get done there must be plenty of commotion and confusion... I am not coming with you.”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“Mr. Lanjayya! You must not say that. Otherwise I will be stained with the charge that I failed in my duty.”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“Hey, Yama-Dharma! Do you know the one way to keep that stain from falling on you?.... If I am to come with you, you must give me a cheque for five lakh rupees right now.”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "Yama-Dharma’s head reeled. “A bribe even for dying?” he muttered.",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“.... If I am to be born in the next birth, I will ask for that too, you know....”",
      "sourceScan": 43,
      "printedPage": 42,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“.... Do not take another birth. Ask for that too right now and give me a little ‘concession’.”",
      "sourceScan": 44,
      "printedPage": 43,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“.... Give me ten lakhs.”",
      "sourceScan": 44,
      "printedPage": 43,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“.... This fellow can only be beaten to death with money,” Yama says, taking out a cheque and writing it. He holds out the cheque.",
      "sourceScan": 44,
      "printedPage": 43,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“Here—die by cash! You, die by cash!”",
      "sourceScan": 44,
      "printedPage": 43,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "Mr. Lanjayya looks at the cheque. “Fifty lakhs.”",
      "sourceScan": 44,
      "printedPage": 43,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "“Ah! Fifty lakhs!” Mr. Lanjayya’s mouth falls open.",
      "sourceScan": 44,
      "printedPage": 43,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "kind": "paragraph",
    "segments": [
     {
      "text": "After that, he never closes it again.",
      "sourceScan": 44,
      "printedPage": 43,
      "joinToNext": "end"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
